ne\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 6% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 365 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.00969863013699\" cy=\"361.05753424657536\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 3%&amp;#10;It rained 11% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 71 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"68.66985915492957\" cy=\"340.98591549295776\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 8%&amp;#10;It rained 15% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 84 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"86.82571428571428\" cy=\"325.6666666666667\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 26%&amp;#10;It rained 38% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"149.2103125\" cy=\"245.5\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 70%&amp;#10;It rained 70% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 70 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"307.51942857142853\" cy=\"127.20000000000002\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(18%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Sfax the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>summer</b> (0.47) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-0.01).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>170</td><td class='num'>32%</td><td class='num'>-0.014</td><td class='num'>15.1%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>162</td><td class='num'>16%</td><td class='num'>0.357</td><td class='num'>4.0%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>149</td><td class='num'>22%</td><td class='num'>0.374</td><td class='num'>6.1%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>173</td><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'>0.474</td><td class='num'>0.6%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":34.74056,"lon":10.76028,"n":654,"n_cities":213,"name":"Sfax","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":2.7397260273972603e-05,"n":365,"obs":0.057534246575342465,"sig":true},{"hi":0.05,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.030140845070422525,"n":71,"obs":0.11267605633802817,"sig":true},{"hi":0.15,"lo":0.05,"mean":0.08142857142857143,"n":84,"obs":0.15476190476190477,"sig":true},{"hi":0.43,"lo":0.15,"mean":0.25765625,"n":64,"obs":0.375,"sig":false},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.43,"mean":0.7048571428571428,"n":70,"obs":0.7,"sig":false}],"prcp_km":4.3,"provisional":false,"rank":115,"rank_hi":154.02499999999998,"rank_lo":62.0,"reliability":0.004625934907578316,"resolution":0.04158993861233161,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"sfax","station":"","timezone":"Africa/Tunis"}